  "brief": {"zh": "这台老控制器只接受 SUB、STORE、HALT。ACC 起初装着参考电平 V，地址 0、1 各有一个采样。把两路采样分别绕 V 镜像：低于 V 几格，就改成高于 V 几格，反之亦然。把原参考电平存到 2，两路新读数写回 0、1，地址 3 和 ACC 提交新 0 减新 1。", "en": "Only SUB, STORE and HALT work on this old controller. ACC starts with the reference voltage V. Reflect each sample at 0 and 1 about V: a reading three below V becomes three above it, and vice versa. Save V at 2 and the two reflected readings at 0 and 1. Put the new reading at 0 minus the new reading at 1 in both 3 and ACC."},
